Z||000004||Bob Englert||05-22-2001||08:48 PM||||The NC Fiero group is centered mostly in the Greensboro and Raleigh area.  We try to get together about once a month, switching locations.  <P>The Southeast VA club would probably be a lot closer to you in Elizabeth City.  Also remember the national show in Williamsburg in early August.<P>Also the 2001 Run For the Hills will probably be in Cherokee, NC in late September.  A great time to tool around the mountains with a lot of great people.<P>Let me know if you want to be on my email list for future NC meetings.<P>Welcome to NC!!!<BR><P>------------------<BR>Bob<BR>2 - 87 GT's<BR>85 SE 4 cyl||||reg||1
