Z||000010||LZeitgeist||05-27-2001||09:32 PM||||Harry - <P>Not a bad idea, but not-so-great logistics.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Much simpler to meet you in Kitty Hawk. <P>We could all meet at the base of the Wright Memorial!!! That would be awesome!<P>And we absolutely *have* to plan to have dinner and the best beer on the planet at the Weeping Radish Bavarian Restaurant and Brewpub in Manteo. There are also locations in Kitty Hawk and Corolla, but the Manteo location is 'home base', and the best experience of the three. (Also has the best accomodations for larger groups.)||||reg||1
