Z||000039||LZeitgeist||05-31-2001||08:30 AM||||July 14th would work for me... I just don't want to have to wait that long! LOL!!<P>If June 30th would be a problem for you, then I'd rather pick another date - wouldn't be right having this thing without you, Harry!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I'll be happy to suggest dining places... Saturday evening festivities at the Weeping Radish in Manteo, for example... once we pick a date and find out the number of people showing up, I'll call and see if I can't get the loft reserved for the group. I'll think about other suggestions for Sunday morning breakfast, etc.<P>We gotta get some more NC/VA people to chime in here - c'mon, gang, let's hash out a date for this thing...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000040||FieroHarry||05-31-2001||01:32 PM||||LZ,<P>I have 10 confirmed people plus myself coming from FOCOSEVA.<P>Sounds like a mini festival <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>In the next couple of weekends Im gonna scope out a the best roads for us to cruise coming in from VA (scenic,smooth etc etc) also the available parking for us at the Monument.<BR>I have never been there but i will try to get us a roped off area just for Fiero's.<P>Bob has put it out via e-mail to try and do this the 14th of July and is asking for feedback.<BR>If he gets as good as response as I have we are in for some nice fun!<P><P>------------------<BR><B>Harry Waggoner</B><BR>1985 GT 264K+ <I>FOCOSEVA,FOCOA</I><BR><B>"Im not driving to fast, Im flying to low!"</B>||||reg||12
